flowchart TD
    %% PoSumo - Dynamic Lifecycle & Execution Loop (SIMPLE)
    %% Conceptual overview of one decision tick at 50 Hz

    Env["Unity Scene: SCN_SUMO / SCN_TRAIN_*"]:::env
    Body["Agent_BipedBody<br/>14-part ragdoll"]:::body
    Agent["Agent_Biped<br/>Brain contract"]:::agent
    Brain["(.onnx Sentis Model<br/>45 obs -> 13 actions)"]:::brain
    Ref["Referee<br/>SumoMatchManager / GameMatchManager"]:::ref
    Tnt["Tournament State<br/>Static 8-slot bracket"]:::tnt
    UI["UI Toolkit HUD<br/>+ Bracket / Career"]:::ui

    Env -->|Physics tick 50 Hz| Body
    Body -->|Sensors: contact, raycast, velocity| Agent
    Agent -->|CollectObservations 45-float vector| Brain
    Brain -->|13 continuous actions| Agent
    Agent -->|motor torques, actionScale| Body
    Body -->|collisions / ring-out| Ref
    Ref -->|terminal +1 / -1| Agent
    Ref -->|RoundStarted / Ended / MatchEnded events| UI
    Tnt -->|entrant roster| Ref

    classDef env fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#3a78c2,color:#0e2a4d
    classDef body fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d9923a,color:#4a2e08
    classDef agent fill:#e8f7e8,stroke:#3a9a3a,color:#103d10
    classDef brain fill:#fde2f3,stroke:#c43b8d,color:#4a0d2c
    classDef ref fill:#fdeeee,stroke:#c93b3b,color:#4a0e0e
    classDef tnt fill:#eee9fb,stroke:#6a3fc9,color:#1f0e4a
    classDef ui fill:#f0f0f0,stroke:#666,color:#222